<title>USA: TABLE-Interstate/Johnson Lane Q3 shr up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Interstate/Johnson Lane Q3 shr up.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Periods ended June 30</p>
<p>			     Q3			   Nine months</p>
<p>		   1997	    1996	     1997	 1996</p>
<p>Total Revs    $56.91	  $52.58	  $166.756    $158.578</p>
<p>Net Income    $2.548	  $2.292	  $7.565	  $7.169</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share:</p>
<p>  Primary	   $0.39     $0.38	   $1.20	   $1.18</p>
<p>  Fully diluted   $0.37     $0.34	   $1.11	   $1.04</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares:</p>
<p>Primary	 6,549,284   6,005,992    6,289,829    6,076,846</p>
<p>Fully Diluted 6,988,662   7,530,097    6,829,605    7,600,951</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said 1997 Q3 EPS of $0.39 reflect dilution of four percent, or $0.02 per share, from additional shares issued in April to certain bondholders who exercised conversion rights when the company called for redemption $21 million of convertible debentures.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1700))</p>
